{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04747","headline":"赴集贤院学士上赐宴应制得辉字 · 张说","name":"赴集贤院学士上赐宴应制得辉字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侍帝金华讲，千龄道固稀。\n位将贤士设，书共学徒归。\n首命深燕隗，通经浅汉韦。\n列筵荣赐食，送客愧儒衣。\n贺燕窥檐下，迁莺入殿飞。\n欲知朝野庆，文教日光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}